				<content:encoded><![CDATA[<p><strong>Madonna</strong>&#8216;s video for <strong>Ghosttown</strong> premiered yesterday on Meerkat App and shortly after on her <a href="https://www.youtube.com/user/MADONNAVEVO/videos" target="_blank">VEVO Channel</a>.</p>
<p class="lis-processed">The pop icon&#8217;s brand new <strong>Ghosttown</strong> video depicts a future where <span id="kco1" class="lis-keyphrase">nuclear</span> blasts have wiped the bulk of humanity. In this nuked out new world we see <strong>Madonna</strong> and <em>Empire</em> <span id="kco0" class="lis-keyphrase">star</span> <strong>Terrence Howard</strong> sharing a dance. Granted, the dance comes after Howard considers sniping the entertainer, but that&#8217;s all part of the story.</p>
<p class="lis-processed">Very moving scenes are when Madonna kisses her mother&#8217;s photo, died when she was only 5 years old.</p>
<p>This latest promo has Madonna teaming up once again with director <strong>Jonas Åkerlund</strong> (<a href="http://drownedmadonna.com/jonas-akerlund-is-the-director-of-ghosttown/20150311" target="_blank">we were the first to reveal it</a>). Previous efforts from this combo include &#8220;Ray of Light,&#8221; &#8220;Music&#8221; and &#8220;American Life.&#8221;</p>
<p>Do you like <strong>Ghosttown</strong> video? Tell us what you think.</p>
<p>The post <a rel="nofollow" href="http://drownedmadonna.com/watch-madonnas-ghosttown-video/20150409">Watch Madonna&#8217;s Ghosttown video.</a> appeared first on <a rel="nofollow" href="http://drownedmadonna.com">Madonna news new album Rebel Heart</a>.</p>
]]></content:encoded>
