				<content:encoded><![CDATA[<p><strong>Terrence Howard</strong>, Empire tv series star, few minutes ago wrote on twitter that the <strong>Ghosttown</strong> video was shot!</p>
<blockquote class="twitter-tweet" width="550"><p>Just wrapped shooting Madonna&#39;s new music video for Ghost town&#8230; She&#39;s the real deal, coming soon! <a href="https://twitter.com/Madonna">@Madonna</a></p>
<p>&mdash; Terrence D Howard (@darkmatter9432) <a href="https://twitter.com/darkmatter9432/status/579342993422880768">March 21, 2015</a></p></blockquote>
<p><script async src="//platform.twitter.com/widgets.js" charset="utf-8"></script></p>
<blockquote class="twitter-tweet" width="550"><p>Madonna and me&#8230; The only 2 souls left! Stay tuned!</p>
<p>&mdash; Terrence D Howard (@darkmatter9432) <a href="https://twitter.com/darkmatter9432/status/579386269270077440">March 21, 2015</a></p></blockquote>
<p><script async src="//platform.twitter.com/widgets.js" charset="utf-8"></script></p>
<p>Also <strong>Madonna</strong> hinted something about the video shooting on Instagram:</p>
<a href="https://instagram.com/p/0Z3IuRGEbj/?taken-by=madonna" title="View on Instagram"><img src="http://instagr.am/p/am.com/media/?size=l" alt="Instagram Photo" /></a>
<a href="https://instagram.com/p/0fKvmfGEXU/?taken-by=madonna" title="View on Instagram"><img src="http://instagr.am/p/am.com/media/?size=l" alt="Instagram Photo" /></a>
