		<description><![CDATA[<p>According to Billboard &#8220;Empire&#8221; star Terrence Howard will be in Madonna&#8216;s &#8220;Ghosttown&#8221; music video.</p>
<p>The post <a rel="nofollow" href="http://drownedmadonna.com/empire-star-terrence-howard-will-be-in-ghosttown-music-video/20150318">&#8220;Empire&#8221; star Terrence Howard will be in &#8220;Ghosttown&#8221; music video.</a> appeared first on <a rel="nofollow" href="http://drownedmadonna.com">Madonna news new album Rebel Heart</a>.</p>
]]></description>
				<content:encoded><![CDATA[<p>According to <a href="http://www.billboard.com/articles/columns/chart-beat/6502441/empire-soundtrack-number-one-madonna-number-two" target="_blank">Billboard</a> &#8220;<strong>Empire</strong>&#8221; star <strong>Terrence Howard</strong> will be in <strong>Madonna</strong>&#8216;s &#8220;<strong>Ghosttown</strong>&#8221; music video.</p>
<blockquote class="pixcode  pixcode--testimonial  testimonial testimonial--small-text">
    <div class="testimonial__content">
<p>Back in the present day, it appears that Madonna herself is a fan of <em>Empire</em>: on March 17, the diva announced that the show&#8217;s Terrence Howard would star in her new music video for <em>Rebel Heart&#8217;s</em> second single, &#8220;Ghosttown.&#8221;</p>
</div>

    </blockquote>

<p>The post <a rel="nofollow" href="http://drownedmadonna.com/empire-star-terrence-howard-will-be-in-ghosttown-music-video/20150318">&#8220;Empire&#8221; star Terrence Howard will be in &#8220;Ghosttown&#8221; music video.</a> appeared first on <a rel="nofollow" href="http://drownedmadonna.com">Madonna news new album Rebel Heart</a>.</p>
]]></content:encoded>
